      "artist": "InSapphoWeTrust from Los Angeles, California, USA",
      "description": "Preserved at Independence Park, Philadelphia, in a pavilion built for the 1976 Bicentennial. In 2003 this pavilion would be replaced by a more secure building just to the west.\n\nI am still a teenager at this point in 1993, and Philadelphia, done as a day trip from New York where I was staying with relatives, was my first-ever solo intercity trip. Although I have gone on to visit many other places around the world as a grownup, I would not return to Philadelphia until October 2011.",
